 "_comment": [
  "The numbers of the paper's tables and figures, in machine-readable form.",
  "Keys are the repository's internal system tags; the display name and the parameter",
  "count are the ones the paper prints. Source: the arXiv version of the paper.",
  "table_7_coqa carries two score blocks per row: 'sub5' (the 1,814 questions whose",
  "gold answer has >=5 ModernBERT tokens; F1/RL/RLsum/calls/chars) and 'all7983' (all",
  "7,983 CoQA dev turns; F1/RL/RLsum only, as the caption states Calls and Chars are",
  "reported for the >=5 cohort only).",
  "Blocks named 'extended_*' are not tables of the paper; they hold the repository's",
  "values for a comparison the paper describes in prose."
 ],
